    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As an Eparch it is your duty to administer sacraments, govern college discipline, and guide liturgy. Your extensive training allows you to do the following:</p><p><strong>Steadfast Will.</strong> If you fail a saving throw, you can expend one of your Bardic Inspiration dice and add the number rolled to your saving throw result.</p><p><strong>Purifying Breath.</strong> You can expend one of your Bardic Inspiration dice to end one of the following conditions on yourself: Charmed, Frightened, Poisoned.</p><p><strong>Hymnal Memory.</strong> After you have finished a Long Rest, you can choose one skill and gain proficiency with it. You retain this proficiency until you finish another Long Rest.</p>"
